+### Phase 27: SemVer Release Changelog Timeline Analyzer, Content-Disposition & Magic-Byte MIME Sniffing Guard, and RO-Crate 1.1 JSON-LD Research Object Exporter
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/changelog-semver-timeline-analyzer.cjs`**:
+  - `extractSemverReleaseChangelog(snapshot)` and `verifyBreakingChangesAndDeprecationsAcrossVersions`: extracts SemVer release blocks (`v4.2.0`, `v3.8.0`) with per-release `eventDate` (distinct from `pageDate` and `fetchedAt`), CVE security advisories (`CVE-2026-4102`), breaking-change markers, and exact UTF-16 `[startUtf16..endUtf16]` offsets, automatically flagging features superseded by newer SemVer releases (`SUPERSEDED_BY_NEWER_SEMVER_RELEASE`).
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/content-disposition-and-mime-sniff-guard.cjs`**:
+  - `verifyDownloadContentDispositionAndMagicBytes`: parses RFC 6266 / RFC 5987 `Content-Disposition` headers (`filename*=UTF-8''...` and `filename="..."`), validates target paths via `resolveAllowedDownloadTarget`, and inspects binary magic signatures (`0x4D 0x5A` Windows PE `MZ`, `0x7F 'E' 'L' 'F'`, `#!`) to block disguised executable payloads (`BROWSER_DISGUISED_EXECUTABLE_PAYLOAD`).
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/ro-crate-research-object-exporter.cjs`**:
+  - `buildRoCrateMetadataDescriptor` and `saveRoCrateResearchPackageViaWorkspace`: packages a multi-site research report into a W3C / ResearchObject.org RO-Crate 1.1 JSON-LD descriptor (`reports/<slug>-ro-crate-metadata.json`) with `CreateAction` search adapter provenance, `WebPage` temporal triads (`datePublished` / `temporalCoverage` / `sdDatePublished`), and `Quotation` entities (`UTF-16 [startUtf16..endUtf16]`).
+- **Exposed via `shell.cjs` (`browser.analyze_semver_changelog`, `browser.verify_semver_feature_status`, `browser.verify_download_magic_bytes`, `browser.export_ro_crate`) and verified in Subtests 46 and 47 (`57/57` total suites passing).**
